# Aegis prompt templates. Empty, and intended to stay that way.
#
# Aegis consults no model. Detection is one set difference over two manifests -
# see agents/manifest_review/diff.py - and `Finding.rationale` is optional, so a
# templated title plus real Evidence is a complete claim.
#
# The directory exists because tests/unit/test_repo_structure.py requires every
# agent to ship one. The TODO that was here said "populate this directory",
# which described work that must not happen: a prompt here would mean Aegis had
# started deciding whether a change is WRONG, and it deliberately only reports
# what a change takes away.
#
# Phase: 3 - Guardrails, Approvals & Write Actions
